### Capstone Backend - Thunder Client / REST Client tests (http://localhost:3001)
### All protected routes need Authorization: Bearer <token> after login

### Health
GET http://localhost:3001/
GET http://localhost:3001/api/health

### Auth - Register
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@sec.edu",
  "password": "test123"
}

### Auth - Login (get token)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@sec.edu",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Auth - Profile (protected)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN

### Students - List (public)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/students

### Students - Create (protected)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN

{
  "name": "New Student",
  "branch": "DS",
  "email": "newstudent@sec.edu"
}

### Students - Update (protected)
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/students/REPLACE_ID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN

{
  "branch": "CSE"
}

### Students - Delete (protected)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/students/REPLACE_ID
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN

### Upload - Generic file (protected) - use Thunder Client Form Data
POST http://localhost:3001/api/upload
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
# field: file = <choose file>

### Upload - Student avatar (protected)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/students/REPLACE_ID/avatar
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN
Content-Type: multipart/form-data
# field: file

### Legacycompat - Exp4 route
GET http://localhost:3001/students

### Legacy compat - verify CORS with Angular
# Angular will call http://localhost:3001/api/students
